### 항상 로그인 먼저 (세션 유지)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 사진 업로드
POST http://localhost:3000/photo/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test_cat.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_images/test_cat.jpg
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

다솜이
--MyBoundary-- 

### 사진 삭제 (예: 3번 사진)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/photo/3

### 댓글 작성
POST http://localhost:3000/comment/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "진짜 귀여워!!"
}

### 댓글 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/comment/5